tle":"Klimavisioner for modernismens bygningskultur : Etageboligbebyggelser 1930-1974","type":"Book","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S02-100.00-793100","year":"2024","yearsub":"2024"}
{"abstract":"The reception history of the Davos Debate may help us gain insight about how to approach the history of philosophy. Firstly, any serious account of a historical debate must be grounded in a sound conception of the intellectual environment in which it took place and as such we cultivate intellectual history. Furthermore, interpretations of historical debates also imply a mirroring of the historical themes in contemporary philosophical discussions, and finally that we can bracket the historical situation in order to focus systematically on the motifs and forms of argumentation in a historical debate. I criticize what I argue is a fourth and popular interpretation strategy of the Davos Debate aiming to declare a winner of the debate. Such an interpretation approach can be aligned with a scholastic fallacy which views philosophy as a means to confirm social group identity rather than free thinking. While scholastic fallacies are common in the history of European philosophy and its reception, I argue that aspirations to think philosophy in its world concept and thus to aspire to understand the laws of human reason imply that we must take intercultural dialogue seriously in our philosophical endeavors.","author_count":4,"contributors":["Pedersen, Esther Oluffa"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-722702"],"filters":{"added":"2024-03","altsrc":["No Matches Found"],"author_count":"2-5 contributors","cluster_size":1,"keyword":["Ernst Cassirer","Hannah Arendt","Immanuel Kant","Martin Heidegger"],"level":"sci","mra":["hum"],"oa":"Undetermined","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-RUC"]},"level3all":["DI-U-RUC"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"the davos debate pure philosophy and normativity thinking from the perspective of the history of philosophy","src":["ruc"],"src-code":["DI-U-RUC"],"type":"dba","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"id":"S01-000.00-722702","identifier":[{"id":"85216968693","type":"scopus"}],"ids":["ruc-23a929da-475e-4cbc-8135-a9dd7437957e"],"keyword":["Critique of pure philosophy","Davos debate","Ernst Cassirer","Finitude and infinity in human thinking","Hannah Arendt","Immanuel Kant","Martin Heidegger","Scholastic fallacy","Strategies of interpretation in the history of philosophy","World concept of philosophy vs. the school concept of philosophy"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Humanities"],"noi":["Global-Local-2-2-75E4405F3D250481801D837832317BD0"],"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"ruc roskilde university","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-RUC","l3nl":"Roskilde University","l3nn":"RUC Roskilde University","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"RUC Roskilde University","namevar":["Roskilde University, Department of Communication and Arts"],"nora_code":"DI-U-RUC","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","country":"dk","first":"Esther Oluffa","key":"pedersenpau","last":"Pedersen","locid":"a52e053f-e5aa-4d19-9d6b-5217c32e61df","name":"Pedersen, Esther Oluffa","orcid":"0000-0001-8963-9860","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"","first":"Ralf","key":"müllerpedh","last":"Müller","name":"Müller, Ralf","rank":2,"role":"Editor of Host Publication","rolecode":"pedh"},{"affno":"","first":"Tobias","key":"endrespedh","last":"Endres","name":"Endres, Tobias","rank":3,"role":"Editor of Host Publication","rolecode":"pedh"},{"affno":"","first":"Domenico","key":"schneiderpedh","last":"Schneider","name":"Schneider, Domenico","rank":4,"role":"Editor of Host Publication","rolecode":"pedh"}],"pub":{"doi":"10.1163/9789004680173_004","pages":"71-91","publisher":"Brill","status":"p","subtitle":"Cassirer, Heidegger, and the Kyoto School of Philosophy","title":"Kyoto in Davos","volume":"Kyoto in Davos"},"review":"Peer Reviewed","search":{"DAF":["All Danish Affiliations","All Universities","DI-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","Roskilde University","Universities"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["ruc-23a929da-475e-4cbc-8135-a9dd7437957e"],"src":["RUC Roskilde University"],"title":"The Davos Debate, Pure Philosophy and Normativity : Thinking from the Perspective of the History of Philosophy","type":"Book Chapter","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S01-000.00-722702","year":"2024","yearsub":"2024"}
{"abstract":"Mange mennesker lever med nedsat gangfunktion efter erhvervet hjerneskade. Det kan føre til reduceret selvhjulpenhed og nedsat deltagelse i daglige aktiviteter. Højintensiv gangtræning (HIGT) er en veldokumenteret behandlingstilgang som kan medføre forbedret gang og balance. Dermed vil HIGT kunne bidrage til et mere aktivt og uafhængigt liv med en oplevelse af øget livskvalitet.","author_count":12,"contributors":["Hansen, Gunhild Mo","Riis, Allan","Brunner, Iris Charlotte","Rovsing Jørgensen, Helle","Tøfting Jensen, Jette","Søhus, Christina","Nielsen, Maria","Mark, Anton Bolvig","Holt Christensen, Anders","Wested, Carina Lykke","Lund Pedersen, Kristian Aagaard","Abildtrup, Tobias"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-751260"],"event":{"end":"2024-04-22","place":"Ålborg, dk","start":"2024-04-22","title":"Forskningens Døgn, UCN","year":"2024"},"filters":{"added":"2024-08","altsrc":["No Matches Found"],"author_count":"11-50 contributors","cluster_size":1,"keyword":["Sundhed ernæring og livskvalitet","Sygdom sundhedsvidenskab og sygepleje","Undersøgelsesdesign teori og metode"],"level":"pop","mra":["med"],"oa":"Undetermined","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-HO","DI-OT","DI-U","DI-UC"],"level3":{"HO":["DI-HO-ALL","DI-HO-OTH"],"OT":["Neuroenheden Nord, Brønderslev"],"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-AU"],"UC":["DI-UC-ALL","DI-UC-UCN"]},"level3all":["DI-HO-OTH","DI-U-AU","DI-UC-UCN"]},"review":"und","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"flere skridt med højintensiv gangtræning efter erhvervet hjerneskade et samarbejde mellem kommuner sygehuse og ucn højintensiv gangtræning efter hjerneskade","src":["ucn"],"src-code":["DI-UC-UCN"],"type":"dco","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"id":"S01-000.00-751260","ids":["ucn-2fdc6eb1-0237-4be9-8b38-7a6c1614f382"],"keyword":["Sundhed, ernæring og livskvalitet","Sygdom, sundhedsvidenskab og sygepleje","Undersøgelsesdesign, teori og metode"],"lang":"Danish","level":"Popular","mra":["Medical Science"],"noi":["Local-1-1-8F98823468BF3D00395EC0E289D