{"abstract":"In 2019 the UK Myeloma Research Alliance introduced the Myeloma Risk Profile (MRP) for prediction of outcome in patients with newly diagnosed multiple myeloma (MM), ineligible for autologous stem cell transplantation. To validate the MRP in a population-based setting we performed a study of the entire cohort of transplant ineligible MM patients above 65 years in the Danish National MM Registry. Our data confirmed the value of the MRP. In a cohort of 1,377 patients, the MRP score separated patients into three distinct risk-groups with an observed hazard ratio of 2.91 for early death in high-risk versus low-risk patients.","author_count":20,"contributors":["Redder, Louise","Klausen, Tobias W","Vangsted, Annette Juul","Gregersen, Henrik","Andersen, Niels Frost","Pedersen, Robert S","Szabo, Agoston G","Frederiksen, Mikael","Frølund, Ulf C","Helleberg, Carsten","Nielsen, Lene Kongsgaard","Pedersen, Per T","Salomo, Morten","Gimsing, Peter","Frederiksen, Henrik","Abildgaard, Niels"],"cuid":["S04-100.00-008227"],"filters":{"added":"2021-10","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"11-50 contributors","class":"merged","cluster_size":4,"corresponding_author":["Redder, Louise"],"keyword":["Geriatric","Multiple myeloma","Myeloma Risk Profile","Myelomatose","Prognosis","Survival"],"level":"sci","mra":["med"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"Yes","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-HO","DI-OT","DI-U"],"level3":{"HO":["DI-HO-ALL","DI-HO-CAP","DI-HO-CDR","DI-HO-NDR","DI-HO-SDR","DI-HO-ZEA"],"OT":["Esbjerg og Grindsted Sygehus"],"U":["DI-U-AAU","DI-U-ALL","DI-U-AU","DI-U-KU","DI-U-SDU"]},"level3all":["DI-HO-CAP","DI-HO-CDR","DI-HO-NDR","DI-HO-SDR","DI-HO-ZEA","DI-U-AAU","DI-U-AU","DI-U-KU","DI-U-SDU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"validation of the uk myeloma research alliance risk profile a new clinical prediction model for outcome in patients with newly diagnosed multiple myeloma not eligible for autologous stem cell transplantation a population based study from the danish national multiple myeloma registry","src":["aau","au","ku","sdu"],"src-code":["DI-U-AAU","DI-U-AU","DI-U-KU","DI-U-SDU"],"type":"dja","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","license":"Ikke-specificeret","type":"loc","url":"https://curis.ku.dk/ws/files/333630714/Validation_of_the_UK_myeloma_research_alliance_risk_profile_2_11.pdf","version":"Authors Final Version"},"funding_acknowledgement":["The work was supported by the Danish Cancer Society and the Academy of Geriatric Cancer Research (AgeCare), Odense University Hospital, Denmark."],"id":"S04-100.00-008227","identifier":[{"id":"85086048766","type":"scopus"},{"id":"000538790400001","type":"wos"},{"id":"32515050","type":"pmid"}],"ids":["aau-aa9f3e41-576c-4296-92c3-140001af08a4","au-837ffc81-d6a6-4c5a-ab1b-4c7574cd79f5","ku-0dd31db9-41d1-451d-9a06-e272412c39c0","sdu-2b0417db-4ca9-4e3f-9549-70e5abf9d526"],"keyword":["Myeloma Risk Profile","Myelomatose","geriatric","multiple myeloma","prognosis","survival"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Medical Science"],"noi":["Global-Local-2-7-179929D6D5B1CDC8985DF7D66CC89FE7"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","type":"loc","url":"https://vbn.aau.dk/ws/files/517708881/bjh.16806.pdf","version":"Authors Final Version"},{"access":"oa","license":"Ikke-specificeret","type":"loc","url":"https://curis.ku.dk/ws/files/333630714/Validation_of_the_UK_myeloma_research_alliance_risk_profile_2_11.pdf","version":"Authors Final Version"},{"access":"oa","type":"loc","url":"https://findresearcher.sdu.dk/ws/files/170676263/bjh.16806.pdf","version":"Authors Final Version"}],"oai":{"class":"Realised","mra":["Medicine (MED)"],"yearPub":"2021","yearSub":"2021"},"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"sdu university of southern denmark","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-SDU","l3nl":"University of Southern Denmark","l3nn":"SDU University of Southern Denmark","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"SDU University of Southern Denmark","namevar":["SDU, The Fac