{"abstract":"Communal buildings have been reported from a number of early Neolithic sites from the Levant and Anatolia, but none were known from the central Zagros. Here we report on the recent excavations at Asiab, Kermanshah province, Iran, and argue that the principle feature found during Robert Braidwood’s excavation at the site in 1960 should be interpreted as an example of a communal building. We discuss the results of the previous and recent excavations, highlight the key features of this building, and the implications for our understanding of the early Neolithic in the ‘eastern wing’ of the Fertile Crescent.","author_count":11,"contributors":["Richter, Tobias","Darabi, Hojjat","Alibaigi, Sajjad","Otaegui, Amaia Arranz","Bangsgaard, Pernille","Khosravi, Shouku","Maher, Lisa","Mortensen, Peder","Pedersen, Patrick Nørskov","Roe, Joe","Yeomans, Lisa Marie"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-494163"],"filters":{"added":"2021-12","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"11-50 contributors","cluster_size":1,"continent":["America, North","Asia, Middle East","OECD"],"country":["Iran","United States"],"glorg":["All Global Affiliations","Razi University","University of California at Berkeley"],"level":"sci","mra":["hum"],"oa":"Undetermined","oaiscope":"Yes","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-KU"]},"level3all":["DI-U-KU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"the formation of early neolithic communities in the central zagros an 000000000011 000000000500 year old communal structure at asiab","src":["ku"],"src-code":["DI-U-KU"],"type":"dja","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"id":"S01-000.00-494163","identifier":[{"id":"85100981632","type":"scopus"}],"ids":["ku-a89f0c0b-28cb-431e-93e4-b34f4ff6c74f"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Humanities"],"noi":["Global-Local-2-4-811AEB568D70786020419BAF8C79A946"],"oai":{"class":"Blocked","mra":["Humanities (HUM)"],"yearPub":"2021","yearSub":"2021"},"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"ku university of c