s : A Randomized Controlled Trial","type":"Journal Article","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S03-099.86-003953","year":"2021","yearsub":"2021"}
{"abstract":"Fusarium pigmentation is dictated by a set of two polyketide synthase (PKS) gene clusters where one is expressed during mycelial growth and the other during perithecial development. In the vast majority of Fusarium species, perithecial pigmentation relies on the PKS3 gene cluster responsible for biosynthesis of fusarubins and bostrycoidins. In these species, mycelial pigmentation is mediated by bikaverin or aurofusarin. However, the situation is different for F. solani where mycelial pigmentation is controlled by the PKS3 gene cluster, while the less common PKS35 is responsible for the perithecial pigmentation, although no actual compound(s) has ever been associated with the latter. We set out to characterize the polyketide pigments of F. solani. The PKS3 gene cluster of F. solani shares seven genes with the previously characterized clusters in F. graminearum and F. fujikuroi. However, it differs from the previously described clusters by containing additional genes, some with predicted enzymatic function related to secondary metabolism. When we overexpressed the cluster specific transcription factor in F. solani, we observed a massive increase in production of javanicin, bostrycoidin, fusarubin and dihydrofusarubin. In order to investigate the perithecial pigment chemistry we performed heterologous expression of the PKS35 in Saccharomyces cerevisiae, yielding prephenalenone and dehydroxyprephenalenone as the initial polyketide intermediates. Secondly, we overexpressed the local transcription factor gene in F. solani, resulting in a dark green and orange/red phenotype. We identified three new candidate compounds by mass spectrometry. To our surprise, the mutant also produced elevated levels of javanicin and bostrycoidin obscuring the observation and isolation of PKS35-related compounds. Interestingly, this co-expression indicates the regulation of both PKS3 and PKS35 gene clusters is somehow connected.","author_count":7,"contributors":["Nielsen, Mikkel Rank","Pedersen, Tobias Bruun","Evelyne Kabemba Kaniki, Samba","Holzwarth, Anna Karolina Rilana","Wimmer, Reinhard","Sondergaard, Teis Esben","Sørensen, Jens Laurids"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-053210"],"event":{"end":"2020-02-20","place":"Rom, it","start":"2020-02-17","title":"15th European Conference on Fungal Genetics","year":"2020"},"filters":{"added":"2021-12","altsrc":["No Matches Found"],"author_count":"6-10 contributors","cluster_size":1,"corresponding_author":["Nielsen, Mikkel Rank"],"keyword":["Fungal biosynthetic genes","Fusarium pigmentation","Fusarium solani species complex","Peritheical pigmentation"],"level":"sci","mra":["sci"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-AAU","DI-U-ALL"]},"level3all":["DI-U-AAU"]},"review":"nr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"solving the polyketide pigmentation puzzle in fusarium solani linking biosynthetic genes to compounds","src":["aau"],"src-code":["DI-U-AAU"],"type":"dco","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","type":"loc","url":"https://vbn.aau.dk/ws/files/329107366/ECFG15_Poster_100x70_MRN_3.pdf","version":"Other Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-053210","ids":["aau-0aec8fcb-7455-4483-927e-4f7cffa4accd"],"keyword":["Fungal biosynthetic genes","Fusarium pigmentation","Fusarium solani species complex","Peritheical pigmentation"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Science/Technology"],"noi":["Local-1-1-0C444B624E4D29B186F710A948F2563C"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","type":"loc","url":"https://vbn.aau.dk/ws/files/329107366/ECFG15_Poster_100x70_MRN_3.pdf","version":"Other Version"}],"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"aau aalborg university","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-AAU","l3nl":"Aalborg University","l3nn":"AAU Aalborg University","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"AAU Aalborg University","namevar":["Aalborg University, The Faculty of Engineering and Science","Aalborg University, The Faculty of Engineering and Science, Department of Chemistry and Bioscience","Aalborg University, The Faculty of Engineering and Science, Department of Chemistry and Bioscience, Functional Genomics","Aalborg University, The Faculty of Engineering and Science, Department of Chemistry and Bioscience, Functional Genomics (Plant and Fungal Biotechnology)","Aalborg University, The Faculty of Engineering and Science, Department of Chemistry and Bioscience, Section of Chemical Engineering"],"nora_code":"DI-U-AAU","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Mikkel Rank","key":"nielsenpau","last":"Nielsen","locid":"1f966c21-5cb9-4909-9f4c-d694ffd9becc","name":"Nielsen, Mikkel Rank","orcid":"0000-0003-2408-9444","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Tobias Bruun","key":"pedersenpau","last":"Pedersen","locid":"bc73daa2-870d-4de9-bf18-bd8a23efc501","name":"Pedersen, Tobias Bruun","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Samba","key":"evelynekabembakanikipau","last":"Evelyne Kabemba Kaniki","name":"Evelyne Kabemba Kaniki, Samba","rank":3,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Anna Karolina Rilana","key":"holzwarthpau","last":"Holzwarth","locid":"115e528a-94f3-4104-9ca8-3b67c73f3a4a","name":"Holzwarth, Anna Karolina Rilana","rank":4,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Reinhard","key":"wimmerpau","last":"Wimmer","locid":"1d80e9f3-a391-40e6-a73a-84194aecbb6a","name":"Wimmer, Reinhard","orcid":"0000-0001-6942-5056","rank":5,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Teis Esben","key":"sondergaardpau","last":"Sondergaard","locid":"c4550265-7489-4e7e-a723-b7cfef89912e","name":"Sondergaard, Teis Esben","orcid":"0000-0002-4455-7498","rank":6,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Jens Laurids","key":"sørensenpau","last":"Sørensen","locid":"365188dd-0cdc-4c71-a590-2ccd261ae3df","name":"Sørensen, Jens Laurids","orcid":"0000-0002-2392-5343","rank":7,"rolecode":"pau"}],"pub":{"status":"p"},"review":"No Review","search":{"DAF":["Aalborg University","All Danish Affiliations","All Universities","DI-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","Universities"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["aau-0aec8fcb-7455-4483-927e-4f7cffa4accd"],"src":["AAU Aalborg University"],"title":"Solving the Polyketide Pigmentation Puzzle in Fusarium solani : Linking biosynthetic genes to compounds","type":"Conference Poster","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S01-000.00-053210","year":"2020","yearsub":"2020"}
{"abstract":"Through stepwise recreation of the biosynthetic gene cluster containing PKS3 from Fusarium solani, it was possible to produce the core scaffold compound of bostrycoidin, a red aza-anthraquinone pigment in Saccharomyces cerevisiae. This was achieved through sequential transformation associated recombination (TAR) cloning of FvPPT, fsr1, fsr2, and fsr3 into the pESC-vector system, utilizing the inducible bidirectional galactose promoter for heterologous expression in S. cerevisiae. The production of the core metabolite bostrycoidin was investigated through triplicate growth cultures for 1-4 days, where the maximum titer of bostrycoidin was achieved after 2 days of induction, yielding 2.2 mg/L.","author_count":14,"contributors":["Pedersen, Tobias Bruun","Nielsen, Mikkel Rank","Kristensen, Sebastian Birkedal","Spedtsberg, Eva Mie Lang","Yasmine, Wafaa","Matthiesen, Rikke","Kaniki, Samba Eveline Kabemba","Sørensen, Trine","Petersen, Celine","Muff, Jens","Sondergaard, Teis Esben","Nielsen, Kåre Lehmann","Wimmer, Reinhard","Sørensen, Jens Laurids"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-093516"],"filters":{"added":"2021-12","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"11-50 contributors","cluster_size":1,"corresponding_author":["Sørensen, Jens Laurids"],"keyword":["Bostrycoidin","Fungi","Fusarium","Heterologous expression","Pigments","Polyketides","Yeast"],"level":"sci","mra":["sci"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"Yes","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-AAU","DI-U-ALL"]},"level3all":["DI-U-AAU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"heterologous expression of the core genes in the complex fusarubin gene cluster of i fusarium solani i","src":["aau"],"src-code":["DI-U-AAU"],"type":"dja","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","license":"CC BY 4.0","type":"doi","url":"https://doi.org/10.3390/ijms21207601","version":"Published Version"},"funding_acknowledgement":["Funding: This study was supported by grants from The Danish Research Council, Technology, and Production (Grant No. 7017-00167) and the Novo Nordisk Foundation (NNF18OC0034952)."],"id":"S01-000.00-093516","identifier":[{"id":"33066643","type":"pmid"},{"id":"85092926943","type":"scopus"}],"ids":["aau-95d81d9a-e154-498e-886a-d97f65357866"],"keyword":["Bostrycoidin","Fungi","Fusarium","Heterologous expression","Pigments","Polyketides","Yeast"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Science/Technology"],"noi":["Global-Local-2-4-D1D2CF3E286FC46EC1D493821059E600"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","license":"CC BY 4.0","type":"doi","url":"https://doi.org/10.3390/ijms21207601","version":"Published Version"},{"access":"oa","license":"CC BY 4.0","type":"loc","url":"https://vbn.aau.dk/ws/files/392893257/ijms_21_07601_v2.pdf","version":"Published Version"}],"oai":{"class":"Realised","mra":["Science / Technology (SCI)"],"yearPub":"2020","yearSub":"2020"},"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"aau aalborg university","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-AAU","l3nl":"Aalborg University","l3nn":"AAU Aalborg University","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"AAU Aalborg University","namevar":["Aalborg University, The Faculty of Engineering and Science","Aalborg University, The Faculty of Engineering and Science, Department of Chemistry and Bioscience","Aalborg University, The Faculty of Engineering and Science, Department of Chemistry and Bioscience, Functional Genomics","Aalborg University, The Faculty of Engineering and Science, Department of Chemistry and Bioscience, Section of Chemical Engineering"],"nora_code":"DI-U-AAU","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Tobias Bruun","key":"pedersentobiasbruunpau","last":"Pedersen","locid":"bc73daa2-870d-4de9-bf18-bd8a23efc501","name":"Pedersen, Tobias Bruun","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Mikkel Rank","key":"nielsenmikkelrankpau","last":"Nielsen","locid":"1f966c21-5cb9-4909-9f4c-d694ffd9becc","name":"Nielsen, Mik