{"abstract":"DNA methylation and gene expression are interdependent and both implicated in cancer development and progression, with many individual biomarkers discovered. A joint analysis of the two data types can potentially lead to biological insights that are not discoverable with separate analyses. To optimally leverage the joint data for identifying perturbed genes and classifying clinical cancer samples, it is important to accurately model the interactions between the two data types. Here, we present EBADIMEX for jointly identifying differential expression and methylation and classifying samples. The moderated t-test widely used with empirical Bayes priors in current differential expression methods is generalised to a multivariate setting by developing: (1) a moderated Welch t-test for equality of means with unequal variances; (2) a moderated F-test for equality of variances; and (3) a multivariate test for equality of means with equal variances. This leads to parametric models with prior distributions for the parameters, which allow fast evaluation and robust analysis of small data sets. EBADIMEX is demonstrated on simulated data as well as a large breast cancer (BRCA) cohort from TCGA. We show that the use of empirical Bayes priors and moderated tests works particularly well on small data sets.","author_count":4,"contributors":["Madsen, Tobias","Świtnicki, Michał P","Juul, Malene","Pedersen, Jakob Skou"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-140166"],"filters":{"added":"2021-12","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"2-5 contributors","cluster_size":1,"keyword":["Differential expression","Empirical Bayes","Probabilistic modeling"],"level":"sci","mra":["med"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"Yes","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-AU"]},"level3all":["DI-U-AU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"ebadimex an empirical bayes approach to detect joint differential expression and methylation and to classify samples","src":["au"],"src-code":["DI-U-AU"],"type":"dja","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","type":"loc","url":"https://pure.au.dk/ws/files/209682808/ebadimex.pdf","version":"Published Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-140166","identifier":[{"id":"85075737181","type":"scopus"},{"id":"000502810400003","type":"wos"},{"id":"31734658","type":"pmid"}],"ids":["au-12b5aac7-88c1-43da-a7bb-2aa9beeddcd0"],"keyword":["differential expression","differential methylation","empirical Bayes","probabilistic modeling"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Medical Science"],"noi":["Global-Local-2-4-C0CF11C58CFBF123B054CA1060DFC0B6"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","type":"loc","url":"https://pure.au.dk/ws/files/209682808/ebadimex.pdf","version":"Published Version"}],"oai":{"class":"Realised","mra":["Medicine (MED)"],"yearPub":"2019","yearSub":"2019"},"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"au aarhus university","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-AU","l3nl":"Aarhus University","l3nn":"AU Aarhus University","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"AU Aarhus University","namevar":["Aarhus University, Health, Department of Clinical Medicine, Department of Clinical Medicine - Department of Molecular Medicine (MOMA)"],"nora_code":"DI-U-AU","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Tobias","key":"madsenpau","last":"Madsen","locid":"357e5996-0e47-4e89-9ed6-42b1b76660ae","name":"Madsen, Tobias","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Michał","key":"świtnickipau","last":"Świtnicki","locid":"533adf28-7a85-4f12-b1bd-a5b5d69e83c3","name":"Świtnicki, Michał P","name_org":"Świtnicki, Michał","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Malene","key":"juulpau","last":"Juul","locid":"3e3719ff-26a4-4a1f-bec2-ebe32b44f24b","name":"Juul, Malene","rank":3,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Jakob Skou","key":"pedersenpau","last":"Pedersen","locid":"9c14e87f-2dc3-4c08-a074-146337aff8a0","name":"Pedersen, Jakob Skou","orcid":"0000-0002-7236-4001","rank":4,"rolecode":"pau"}],"pmid":["31734658"],"pub":{"doi":"10.1515/sagmb-2018-0050","issn":["15446115"],"issue":"6","journal":"Statistical Applications in Genetics and Molecular Biology","paperid":"20180050","publisher":"Walter de Gruyter GmbH","publisher_org":"Walterde Gruyter GmbH","status":"p","title":"Statistical Applications in Genetics and Molecular Biology","volume":"18"},"review":"Peer Reviewed","scoID":["2-s2.0-85075737181"],"search":{"DAF":["Aarhus University","All Danish Affiliations","All Universities","DI-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","Universities"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["au-12b5aac7-88c1-43da-a7bb-2aa9beeddcd0"],"src":["AU Aarhus University"],"title":"EBADIMEX : an empirical Bayes approach to detect joint differential expression and methylation and to classify samples","type":"Journal Article","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S01-000.00-140166","year":"2019","yearsub":"2019"}
{"abstract":"We use data from a survey of 2439 farmers in 5 countries around the Baltic Sea (Denmark, Estonia, Finland, Poland and Sweden) to investigate their preferences for adopting agricultural practices aimed at reducing nutrient leaching and greenhouse gas emissions. The measures considered are set-aside, catch crops and reduced fertilization. Contracts vary with respect to the area enrolled, contract length, possibility of premature termination, availability of professional advice and compensation. We quantitatively describe farmers’ preferences in terms of their willingness-to-accept compensation for specific attributes of these contracts, if implemented. The results vary substantially between farm types (farmers’ characteristics) and between the 5 countries, and support differentiation of contract obligations and payments to improve the uptake of Agri-Environmental Schemes. The results can be readily used to improve the design of country-specific nutrient reduction policies, in accordance with the next Common Agricultural Policy.","author_count":13,"contributors":["Hasler, Berit","Czajkowskij, Mikolaj","Elofsson, Katarina","Hansen, Line Block","Konrad, Maria Theresia Hedegaard","Nielsen, Helle Ørsted","Niskanen, Olli","Nömann, Tea","Pedersen, Anders Branth","Peterson, Kaja","Poltimäe, Helen","Häggmark Svensson, Tobias","Zagörska, Katarzyna"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-225441"],"filters":{"added":"2021-12","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"11-50 contributors","cluster_size":1,"continent":["Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"country":["Finland","Poland","Sweden"],"glorg":["All Global Affiliations","Luke Natural Resources Institute Finland","Swedish University of Agricultural Sciences","University of Warsaw"],"keyword":["Agri environmental schemes","Baltic Sea","Choice experiment","Design","Farmers preferences","Mitigation","Participation","Valuation","Willingness","Willingness to accept"],"level":"sci","mra":["sci"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"Yes","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-OT","DI-U"],"level3":{"OT":["Danish Economic Councils"],"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-AU"]},"level3all":["DI-U-AU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"farmers preferences for nutrient and climate related agri environmental schemes a cross country comparison","src":["au"],"src-code":["DI-U-AU"],"type":"dja","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","type":"rem","url":"https://www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/pmc/articles/PMC6814685/pdf/13280_2019_Article_1242.pdf","version":"Published Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-225441","identifier":[{"id":"85074054470","type":"scopus"},{"id":"000490850000001","type":"wos"},{"id":"31625049","type":"pmid"},{"id":"PMC6814685","type":"pmcid"}],"ids":["au-a884e97f-1b05-4451-ae09-c16876ac6a33"],"keyword":["Agri-environmental schemes","BALTIC SEA","CHOICE EXPERIMENT","DESIGN","Farmers' preferences","MITIGATION","PARTICIPATION","VALUATION","WILLINGNESS","Willingness to accept"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Science/Technology"],"noi":["Global-Local-2-4-5E9F82F3EFD8924A019D60EF3080BEDA"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","type":"rem","url":"https://www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/pmc/articles/PMC6814685/pdf/13280_2019_Article_1242.pdf","version":"Published Version"}],"oai":{"class":"Realised","mra":["Science / Technology (SCI)"],"yearPub":"2019","yearSub":"2019"},"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"au aarhus university","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-AU","l3nl":"Aarhus University","l3nn":"AU Aarhus University","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"AU Aarhus University","namevar":["Aarhus University, Technical Sciences, Department of Environmental Science, Department of Environmental Science - Environmental social science and geography"],"nora_code":"DI-U-AU","used":1},{"affno":"2","country":"pl","key":"university of warsaw","loc":["Poland","Europe, EU","OECD"],"name":"University of Warsaw","used":1},{"affno":"3","country":"se","key":"swedish university of agricultural sciences","loc":["Sweden","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"Swedish University of Agricultural Sciences","used":1},{"affno":"4","country":"dk","key":"miscellaneous","l2":"DI-OT","l2n":"Miscellaneous","l3":"DI-OT","l3nl":"Other Research","l3nn":"Miscellaneous","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"Miscellaneous","namevar":["Danish Economic Councils"],"nora_code":"DI-OT","used":1},{"affno":"5","country":"fi","key":"luke natural resources institute finland","loc":["Finland","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"Luke Natural Resources Institute Finland","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Berit","key":"haslerpau","last":"Hasler","locid":"63d231d4-5285-481a-abec-99c2aff93b73","name":"Hasler, Berit","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"2","corresponding":null,"first":"Mikolaj","key":"czajkowskijpau","last":"Czajkowskij","name":"Czajkowskij, Mikolaj","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"3","corresponding":null,"first":"Katarina","key":"elofssonpau","last":"Elofsson","name":"Elofsson, Katarina","rank":3,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"4","corresponding":null,"first":"Line Block","key":"hansenpau","last":"Hansen","name":"Hansen, Line Block","rank":4,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Maria","key":"konradpau","last":"Konrad","locid":"0fafd583-05b5-4b33-83bb-93fc0329c061","name":"Konrad, Maria Theresia Hedegaard","name_org":"Konrad, Maria","rank":5,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Helle Ørsted","key":"nielsenpau","last":"Nielsen","locid":"bdcdffea-9e9d-4ccc-ac6f-09909f0ba05a","name":"Nielsen, Helle Ørsted","orcid":"0000-0003-0486-9662","rank":6,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"5","corresponding":null,"first":"Olli","key":"niskanenpau","last":"Niskanen","name":"Niskanen, Olli","rank":7,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"4","corresponding":null,"first":"Tea","key":"nömannpau","last":"Nömann","name":"Nömann, Tea","rank":8,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Anders Branth","