","name":"Dyrberg, Eva","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"2","first":"Helle W","key":"hendelhellewestergrenpau","last":"Hendel","locid":"0ed6dd56-8353-40da-a0d8-b1bd06e37567","name":"Hendel, Helle Westergren","name_org":"Hendel, Helle W","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"2","first":"Tri Hien Viet","key":"huynhtrihienvietpau","last":"Huynh","locid":"7cd278ac-8b12-404e-9181-06f936c48d84","name":"Huynh, Tri Hien Viet","orcid":"0000-0001-5264-4738","rank":3,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"2","first":"Tobias Wirenfeldt","key":"klausentobiaswirenfeldtpau","last":"Klausen","locid":"94ba8398-4108-4dc5-86df-a5a2101e9f97","name":"Klausen, Tobias Wirenfeldt","rank":4,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"2","first":"Vibeke B","key":"løgagervibekepau","last":"Løgager","locid":"7e61bd60-be88-4e20-a554-7bd6279a9922","name":"Løgager, Vibeke","name_org":"Løgager, Vibeke B","rank":5,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"2","first":"Claus","key":"madsenclausgrevepau","last":"Madsen","locid":"78a74d90-7929-4fb8-a9b0-bb26ee49b680","name":"Madsen, Claus Greve","name_org":"Madsen, Claus","rank":6,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"3","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Erik M","key":"pedersenerikmorrepau","last":"Pedersen","locid":"397a353e-5325-4d03-b334-b0841f4e8daf","name":"Pedersen, Erik Morre","name_org":"Pedersen, Erik M","orcid":"0000-0001-6798-3644","rank":7,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"2","first":"Erik M","key":"pedersenerikmpau","last":"Pedersen","locid":"2aa0142e-1d89-4a61-9dd4-cc03b9375463","name":"Pedersen, Erik M","rank":7,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"","first":"Maria","key":"pedersenmariapau","last":"Pedersen","name":"Pedersen, Maria","rank":8,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"2","first":"Henrik S","key":"thomsenhenrikspau","last":"Thomsen","locid":"c1b9dc28-6145-43cc-a1e7-c8a93ab22ec7","name":"Thomsen, Henrik S","rank":9,"rolecode":"pau"}],"pmid":["30132104"],"pub":{"doi":"10.1007/s00330-018-5682-x","issn":["09387994","14321084"],"issn_org":["09387994"],"issue":"3","journal":"European Radiology","pages":"1221-1230","publisher":"Springer","status":"p","title":"European Radiology","volume":"29"},"review":"Peer Reviewed","scoID":["2-s2.0-85052604103"],"search":{"DAF":["Aarhus University","All Danish Affiliations","All Hospitals","All Universities","Capital Region of Denmark","DI-ALL","DI-HO","DI-HO-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","Hospitals","Universities","University of Copenhagen"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["au-80bee78a-a380-4666-bb11-748cd1a969f0","ku-40988c70-f24c-4383-959f-09b7cd898622"],"src":["AU Aarhus University","KU University of Copenhagen"],"title":"Ga-68-PSMA-PET/CT in comparison with F-18-fluoride-PET/CT and whole-body MRI for the detection of bone metastases in patients with prostate cancer : a prospective diagnostic accuracy study","type":"Journal Article","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S02-099.81-022064","year":"2019","yearsub":"2019"}
{"abstract":"AIMS: To use the rs1229984 variant associated with alcohol consumption as an instrument for alcohol consumption to test the causality of the association of alcohol consumption with hay fever, asthma, allergic sensitization and serum total immunoglobulin (Ig)E. DESIGN: Observational and Mendelian randomization analyses using genetic variants as unbiased markers of exposure to estimate causal effects, subject to certain assumptions. SETTING: Europe. PARTICIPANTS: We included a total of 466 434 people aged 15-82 years from 17 population-based studies conducted from 1997 to 2015. MEASUREMENTS: The rs1229984 (ADH1B) was genotyped; alcohol consumption, hay fever and asthma were self-reported. Specific and total IgE were measured from serum samples. FINDINGS: Observational analyses showed that ever-drinking versus non-drinking, but not amount of alcohol intake, was positively associated with hay fever and inversely associated with asthma but not with allergic sensitization or serum total immunoglobulin (Ig)E. However, Mendelian randomization analyses did not suggest that the observational associations are causal. The causal odds ratio (OR) per genetically assessed unit of alcohol/week was an OR = 0.907 [95% confidence interval (CI) = 0.806, 1.019; P = 0.101] for hay fever, an OR = 0.897 (95% CI = 0.790, 1.019; P = 0.095) for asthma, an OR = 0.971 (95% CI = 0.804, 1.174; P = 0.763) for allergic sensitization and a 4.7% change (95% CI = -5.5%, 14.9%; P = 0.366) for total IgE. CONCLUSIONS: In observational analyses, ever-drinking versus not drinking was positively associated with hay fever and negatively associated with asthma. However, the Mendelian randomization results were not consistent with these associations being causal.","author_count":47,"contributors":["Skaaby, Tea","Kilpeläinen, Tuomas O","Taylor, Amy E","Mahendran, Yuvaraj","Wong, Andrew","Ahluwalia, Tarunveer S","Paternoster, Lavinia","Trompet, Stella","Stott, David J","Flexeder, Claudia","Zhou, Ang","Brusselle, Guy","Sajjad, Ayesha","Lahousse, Lies","Tiemeier, Henning","Have, Christian Theil","Thuesen, Betina H","Kårhus, Line Lund","Møllehave, Line Tang","Leth-Møller, Katja Biering","Shabanzadeh, Daniel Mønsted","Gonzalez-Quintela, Arturo","Power, Chris","Hyppönen, Elina","Kuh, Diana","Hardy, Rebecca","Meitinger, Thomas","Jukema, J Wouter","Völker, Uwe","Nauck, Matthias","Völzke, Henry","Friedrich, Nele","Bonten, Tobias N","Noordam, Raymond","Mook-Kanamori, Dennis O","Tolstrup, Janne S.","Taube, Christian","Peters, Annette","Grallert, Harald","Strauch, Konstantin","Schulz, Holger","Grarup, Niels","Hansen, Torben","Pedersen, Oluf","Burgess, Stephen","Munafò, Marcus R","Linneberg, Allan"],"cuid":["S02-100.00-046098"],"filters":{"added":"2021-10","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"11-50 contributors","class":"merged","cluster_size":2,"continent":["Europe, EU","Europe, Non-EU","OECD","Oceania"],"country":["Australia","Belgium","Germany","Netherlands","Spain","United Kingdom"],"glorg":["All Global Affiliations","Erasmus University Medical Center Rotterdam","Essen University Hospital","German Center for Diabetes Research","Ghent University","Institute of Human Genetics, Helmholtz Zentrum München","Leiden University","Ludwig-Maximilian University of Munich","Technical University of Munich","University Clinical Hospital of Santiago de Compostela","University College London","University Medicine Greifswald","University of Adelaide","University of Bristol","University of Cambridge","University of Glasgow","University of Greifswald","University of South Australia"],"keyword":["Alcohol","Allergic disease","Allergic sensitization","Asthma","Hay fever","Mendelian randomization"],"level":"sci","mra":["med"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"Yes","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-HO","DI-OT","DI-U"],"level3":{"HO":["DI-HO-ALL","DI-HO-CAP"],"OT":["Einthoven Laboratory for Experimental Vascular Medicine, LUMC, Leiden, the Netherlands."],"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-KU","DI-U-SDU"]},"level3all":["DI-HO-CAP","DI-U-KU","DI-U-SDU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"association of alcohol consumption with allergic disease and asthma a multi centre mendelian randomization analysis","src":["ku","sdu"],"src-code":["DI-U-KU","DI-U-SDU"],"type":"dja","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","license":"Ikke-specificeret","type":"loc","url":"https://findresearcher.sdu.dk/ws/files/143273047/Association_of_alcohol_consumption_with_allergic_disease_and_asthma.pdf","version":"Authors Final Version"},"id":"S02-100.00-046098","identifier":[{"id":"30209858","type":"pmid"},{"id":"PMC7613132","type":"pmcid"},{"id":"85055872567","type":"scopus"}],"ids":["ku-c6ff50d0-146d-4a08-a94f-e0ce6671baff","sdu-2a017e31-a7f1-4500-98d0-53fae76cce34"],"keyword":["Alcohol","allergic disease","allergic sensitization","asthma","hay fever","mendelian randomization"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Medical Science"],"noi":["Global-Local-2-5-DCD6ED32376BF388B3C371A366233CBD"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","type":"loc","url":"https://curis.ku.dk/ws/files/254523542/Association_of_alcohol_consumption_with_allergic_disease_OA.pdf","version":"Authors Final Version"},{"access":"oa","license":"Ikke-specificeret","type":"loc","url":"https://findresearcher.sdu.dk/ws/files/143273047/Association_of_alcohol_consumption_with_allergic_disease_and_asthma.pdf","version":"Authors Final Version"}],"oai":{"class":"Realised","mra":["Medicine (MED)"],"yearPub":"2019","yearSub":"2019"},"org":[{"affno":"1","country":"dk","key":"capital region of denmark","l2":"DI-HO","l2n":"Hospitals","l3":"DI-HO-CAP","l3nl":"Capital Region of Denmark","l3nn":"Capital Region of Denmark","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"Capital Region of Denmark","namevar":["Bispebjerg and Frederiksberg Hospitals"],"nora_code":"DI-HO-CAP","used":1},{"affno":"2","key":"ku university of copenhagen","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-KU","l3nl":"University of Copenhagen","l3nn":"