{"abstract":"This case describes how the Maabjerg BioEnergy biogas plant was planned and constructed as a central part of a comprehensive industrial symbiosis near Holstebro in rural Jutland, Denmark. The case also describes how – and why, the subsequent plans to evolve the Maabjerg BioEnergy biogas based symbiosis into a more advanced industrial symbiosis in the Maabjerg BioEnergy Concept to this date have been unsuccessful. The story about Maabjerg BioEnergy and the Maabjerg BioEnergy Concept is a story about technical, economical and administrative challenges as well as a story about innovative technical, economical and administrative solutions. In addition, it is a story about a pioneering spirit developing and solidifying within the Danish bio-based economy, about the rise and fall of hopes and ambitions for fast development towards a green transportation sector, and about the slow and tiresome process of realizing new biorefinery concepts and symbiosis ideas and related markets and policies in Denmark and EU.","author_count":7,"contributors":["Thomsen, Tobias Pape","Christensen, Thomas Budde","Lybæk, Rikke","Thomsen, Sune Tjalfe","Lunde, Alan","pedersen, søren holm"],"cuid":["S02-097.62-044566"],"filters":{"added":"2021-12","altsrc":["No Matches Found"],"author_count":"6-10 contributors","class":"merged","cluster_size":2,"keyword":["Bioenergy","Biogas","Industrial symbiosis","Policy brief"],"level":"sci","mra":["sci","soc"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-PR","DI-U"],"level3":{"PR":["DI-PR-ALL","DI-PR-OTH"],"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-KU","DI-U-RUC"]},"level3all":["DI-PR-OTH","DI-U-KU","DI-U-RUC"]},"review":"nr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"maabjerg bioenergy center development of technical solutions politics and business concepts across 000000000020 years","src":["ku","ruc"],"src-code":["DI-U-KU","DI-U-RUC"],"type":"dr","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","license":"CC BY","type":"loc","url":"https://rucforsk.ruc.dk/ws/files/85874432/RUC_KU_Vestforsyning_2019_Industrial_Symbiosis_Policy_brief_the_MEC_case.pdf","version":"Published Version"},"id":"S02-097.62-044566","ids":["ku-968e7ad4-1999-4698-8db7-46c7b7369041","ruc-8e320af5-171e-4861-b9c9-585da80c44f9"],"keyword":["Bioenergy","Biogas","Industrial symbiosis","Policy brief"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Science/Technology","Social Science"],"noi":["Local-1-2-88EA311BA8C6268D446FB051914A5CDF"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","license":"CC BY","type":"loc","url":"https://rucforsk.ruc.dk/ws/files/85874432/RUC_KU_Vestforsyning_2019_Industrial_Symbiosis_Policy_brief_the_MEC_case.pdf","version":"Published Version"}],"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"ruc roskilde university","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-RUC","l3nl":"Roskilde University","l3nn":"RUC Roskilde University","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"RUC Roskilde University","namevar":["Roskilde University, Department of People and Technology"],"nora_code":"DI-U-RUC","used":1},{"affno":"2","country":"dk","key":"ku university of copenhagen","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-KU","l3nl":"University of Copenhagen","l3nn":"KU University of Copenhagen","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"KU University of Copenhagen","namevar":["University of Copenhagen"],"nora_code":"DI-U-KU","used":1},{"affno":"3","country":"dk","key":"other companies","l2":"DI-PR","l2n":"Private Research","l3":"DI-PR-OTH","l3nl":"Other Companies","l3nn":"Other Companies","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"Other Companies","namevar":["Vestforsyning A/S"],"nora_code":"DI-PR-OTH","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","country":"dk","first":"Tobias Pape","key":"thomsentobiaspapepau","last":"Thomsen","locid":"e0f8cb5c-1327-4f91-99a5-2da7ebda73e8","name":"Thomsen, Tobias Pape","orcid":"0000-0003-3597-7199","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","country":"dk","first":"Thomas Budde","key":"christensenthomasbuddepau","last":"Christensen","locid":"4cd1a857-d7c3-43e9-a508-e90e13881f8b","name":"Christensen, Thomas Budde","orcid":"0000-0002-5505-2567","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","country":"dk","first":"Rikke","key":"lybækrikkepau","last":"Lybæk","locid":"55931da9-f331-4eee-b642-db6d2fae41de","name":"Lybæk, Rikke","orcid":"0000-0002-4858-563X","rank":3,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"2","first":"Sune Tjalfe","key":"thomsensunetjalfepau","last":"Thomsen","name":"Thomsen, Sune Tjalfe","orcid":"0000-0001-8908-9977","rank":4,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"3","first":"Alan","key":"lundealanpau","last":"Lunde","name":"Lunde, Alan","rank":5,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"","first":"søren holm","key":"pedersensørenholmpau","last":"pedersen","name":"pedersen, søren holm","rank":6,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"3","first":"Søren","key":"holmpedersensørenpau","last":"Holm Pedersen","name":"Holm Pedersen, Søren","rank":6,"rolecode":"pau"}],"pub":{"pages":"33","publisher":"Roskilde Universitet","status":"p"},"review":"No Review","search":{"DAF":["All Danish Affiliations","All Private Research","All Universities","DI-ALL","DI-PR","DI-PR-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","Other Companies","Private Research","Roskilde University","Universities","University of Copenhagen","vestforsyning a/s"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["ku-968e7ad4-1999-4698-8db7-46c7b7369041","ruc-8e320af5-171e-4861-b9c9-585da80c44f9"],"src":["KU University of Copenhagen","RUC Roskilde University"],"title":"MAABJERG BIOENERGY CENTER : Development of technical solutions, politics and business concepts across 20 years","type":"Report","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S02-097.62-044566","year":"2019","yearsub":"2019"}
{"abstract":"Harbor seals (Phoca vitulina) inhabit the seas surrounding Denmark and are an important top predator in the marine food chain. This trophic position exposes them to environmental contaminants with disease epidemics and hunting being additional threats to this population. It is therefore important to study how environmental pollution at the current order of magnitude affects the health of the population. Earlier studies have shown that occurrence of periodontitis could be linked to the amount of pollution the seals were subjected to. In order to investigate this further, 380 skulls and 141 mandibles of harbor seals (Phoca vitulina) from the Wadden Sea, the Limfjord, and Kattegat collected during the period 1970–2014 were examined. The skulls were examined for pathological lesions. The Hounsfield Units (HU) which are correlated to the bone mineral density (BMD) were measured in a subsample (n = 34) using CT scans. The macroscopic examination revealed (with the exception of the Swedish part of Kattegat) a significant increase of pathological lesions over the study period of 1981–2014. The examination of HU showed that median HU measured at multiple sites was highest in the healthy skulls compared to the skulls with one or more of the lesions. A discriminant analysis allowed high discriminatory capacity to separate healthy skulls from the skulls with pathologies, simply by the utilization of the HU data. Former studies of BMD in marine mammals have shown that exposure to environmental chemicals alter BMD and cause periodontitis. The present study, based on temporal and spatial trends in BMD, confirms the results of previous studies.","author_count":12,"contributors":["Pertoldi, Cino","Jensen, Lasse Fast","Alstrup, Aage Kristian Olsen","Munk, Ole Lajord","Pedersen, Trine Bæk","Sonne, Christian","Dietz, Rune","Daugaard-Petersen, Tobias","Kortegaard, Hanne E","Olsen, Morten Tange","Hårding, Karin Charlotte","Jensen, Trine Hammer"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-150872"],"filters":{"added":"2021-12","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"11-50 contributors","cluster_size":1,"keyword":["CT scans","Exostosis","Foramina","Hounsfield units","Mineral bone density","Periodontitis"],"level":"sci","mra":["sci"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"Yes","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-OT","DI-U"],"level3":{"OT":["Aalborg Zoo"],"U":["DI-U-AAU","DI-U-ALL","DI-U-AU","DI-U-KU"]},"level3all":["DI-U-AAU","DI-U-AU","DI-U-KU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"prevalence of skull pathologies in european harbor seals phoca vitulina during 000000001981 000000002014","src":["au"],"src-code":["DI-U-AU"],"type":"dja","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","type":"doi","url":"https://doi.org/10.1007/s13364-017-0340-2","version":"Published Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-150872","identifier":[{"id":"85040018772","type":"scopus"}],"ids":["au-25870e13-3095-479d-9c47-c83ca89f4534"],"keyword":["CT scans","Exostosis","Foramina","Hounsfield units","Mineral-bone-density","Periodontitis"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Science/Technology"],"noi":["Global-Local-3-6-E406C310D403833D46E37CE468085572"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","type":"doi","url":"https://doi.org/10.1007/s13364-017-0340-2","version":"Published Version"}],"oai":{"class":"Unused","mra":["Medicine (MED)"],"yearPub":"2017","yearSub":"2017"},"org":[{"affno":"1","country":"dk","key":"aau aalborg university","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-AAU","l3nl":"Aalborg University","l3nn":"AAU Aalborg University","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"AAU Aalborg University","namevar":["Aalborg University (AAU)"],"nora_code":"DI-U-AAU","used":1},{"affno":"2","country":"dk","key":"miscellaneous","l2":"DI-OT","l2n":"Miscellaneous","l3":"DI-OT","l3nl":"Other Research","l3nn":"Miscellaneous","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"Miscellaneous","namevar":["Aalborg Zoo"],"nora_code":"DI-OT","used":1},{"affno":"3","key":"au aarhus university","l2":