{"abstract":"The synthesis of all eight rare but biologically important 6deoxy-L-hexoses as their thioglycoside glycosyl donors starting from the commercially available L-rhamnose or L-fucose is reported. The synthesis of all eight 6-deoxy-L-hexoses was accomplished using a variety of epimerization methods, which revealed some general trends. The stereoselective reduction of 4-oxopyranosides could be predicted by the Cram chelation model, while Mitsunobu conditions led to elimination in some substrates.","author_count":3,"contributors":["Frihed, Tobias","Pedersen, Christian Marcus","Bols, Mikael"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-512645"],"filters":{"added":"2021-12","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"2-5 contributors","cluster_size":1,"keyword":["Carbohydrates","Diastereoselectivity","Nucleophilic substitution","Reduction","Substituent effects"],"level":"sci","mra":["sci"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"Yes","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-KU"]},"level3all":["DI-U-KU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"synthesis of all eight stereoisomeric 000000000006 deoxy l hexopyranosyl donors trends in using stereoselective reductions or mitsunobu epimerizations","src":["ku"],"src-code":["DI-U-KU"],"type":"dja","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","type":"doi","url":"https://doi.org/10.1002/ejoc.201403074","version":"Other Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-512645","identifier":[{"id":"84919363713","type":"scopus"}],"ids":["ku-c7bbb0d1-62b6-4c85-8b0c-c03a1d0c29c6"],"keyword":["6-Deoxy-l-sugars","Carbohydrates","Diastereoselectivity","Nucleophilic substitution","Reduction","Substituent effects"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Science/Technology"],"noi":["Global-Local-2-4-23A4CB12498EA4D8027AF878807AC5B6"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","type":"doi","url":"https://doi.org/10.1002/ejoc.201403074","version":"Other Version"}],"oai":{"class":"Blocked","mra":["Science / Technology (SCI)"],"yearPub":"2014","yearSub":"2014"},"