{"abstract":"Screen printing is a proven manufacturing technology enabling high volume production at low cost. This letter investigates the achievable efficiency of a screen-printed silver antenna structure for 4G mobile phone implementation, with a market-ready solution. The contribution of each element of the solution to the total efficiency is detailed.","author_count":5,"contributors":["Barrio, Samantha Caporal Del","Holmgaard, Tobias","Christensen, Morten","Morris, Art","Pedersen, Gert Frølund"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-120792"],"filters":{"added":"2021-12","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"2-5 contributors","cluster_size":1,"continent":["America, North","OECD"],"country":["United States"],"glorg":["All Global Affiliations","WiSpry"],"level":"sci","mra":["sci"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"Yes","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-PR","DI-U"],"level3":{"PR":["DI-PR-ALL","DI-PR-OTH"],"U":["DI-U-AAU","DI-U-ALL"]},"level3all":["DI-PR-OTH","DI-U-AAU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"screen printed silver ink antennas for frequency reconfigurable architectures in lte phones","src":["aau"],"src-code":["DI-U-AAU"],"type":"dja","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","type":"loc","url":"https://vbn.aau.dk/ws/files/207095578/sample_v2.pdf","version":"Pre-print"},"id":"S01-000.00-120792","identifier":[{"id":"WOS:000344942600009","type":"wos"},{"id":"84912117499","type":"scopus"}],"ids":["aau-f348200c-8d4d-40d3-b423-9ba55ef9d62a"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Science/Technology"],"noi":["Global-Local-2-4-80A7379ED5CC02F0140EA1FD5BBED629"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","type":"loc","url":"https://vbn.aau.dk/ws/files/207095578/sample_v2.pdf","version":"Pre-print"}],"oai":{"class":"Realised","mra":["Science / Technology (SCI)"],"yearPub":"2014","yearSub":"2014"},"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"aau aalborg university","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-AAU","l3nl":"Aalborg University","l3nn":"AAU Aalborg University","loc":["Denmark"