rst":"Lavinia G","key":"marinescupedersenpau","last":"Marinescu-Pedersen","locid":"8948e50e-125c-442e-b995-923ecf40faa6","name":"Marinescu-Pedersen, Lavinia G","rank":4,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"2","first":"Christian Marcus","key":"pedersenpau","last":"Pedersen","locid":"994945e4-c86b-4440-b9bd-8117822c77db","name":"Pedersen, Christian Marcus","orcid":"0000-0003-4661-4895","rank":5,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"2","first":"Mikael","key":"bolspau","last":"Bols","locid":"23a8a20e-b9f1-4bf5-ae25-3377249ae440","name":"Bols, Mikael","orcid":"0000-0002-6561-6952","rank":6,"rolecode":"pau"}],"pub":{"issn":["10990690","1434193X"],"issn_org":["1434193X"],"journal":"European Journal of Organic Chemistry","pages":"5279-5290","status":"p","title":"European Journal of Organic Chemistry","volume":"27"},"review":"Peer Reviewed","scoID":["2-s2.0-80052490288"],"search":{"DAF":["Aarhus University","All Danish Affiliations","All Universities","DI-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","Universities","University of Copenhagen"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["ku-8d1f7ffb-74b2-47b3-8d3f-d2f9baf5032d"],"src":["KU University of Copenhagen"],"title":"Recognition of Peptides by Cyclodextrin Trimers","type":"Journal Article","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S01-000.00-477820","year":"2011","yearsub":"2011"}
{"abstract":"Objectives To evaluate the individual risk factors composing the CHADS2 (Congestive heart failure, Hypertension, Age=75 years, Diabetes, previous Stroke) score and the CHA2DS2-VASc (CHA2DS2-Vascular disease, Age 65-74 years, Sex category) score and to calculate the capability of the schemes to predict thromboembolism. Design Registry based cohort study. Setting Nationwide data on patients admitted to hospital with atrial fibrillation. Population All patients with atrial fibrillation not treated with vitamin K antagonists in Denmark in the period 1997- 2006. Main outcome measures Stroke and thromboembolism. Results Of 121 280 patients with non-valvular atrial fibrillation, 73 538 (60.6%) fulfilled the study inclusion criteria. In patients at “low risk” (score=0), the rate of thromboembolism per 100 person years was 1.67 (95% confidence interval 1.47 to 1.89) with CHADS2 and 0.78 (0.58 to 1.04) with CHA2DS2-VASc at one year’s follow-up. In patients at “intermediate risk” (score=1), this rate was 4.75 (4.45 to 5.07) with CHADS2 and 2.01 (1.70 to 2.36) with CHA2DS2-VASc. The rate of thromboembolism depended on the individual risk factors composing the scores, and both schemes underestimated the risk associated with previous thromboembolic events. When patients were categorised into low, intermediate, and high risk groups, C statistics at 10 years’ follow-up were 0.812 (0.796 to 0.827) with CHADS2 and 0.888 (0.875 to 0.900) with CHA2DS2-VASc. Conclusions The risk associated with a specific risk stratification score depended on the risk factors composing the score. CHA2DS2-VASc performed better than CHADS2 in predicting patients at high risk, and those categorised as low risk by CHA2DS2-VASc were truly at low risk for thromboembolism.","author_count":14,"contributors":["Olesen, Jonas Bjerring","Lip, Gregory Y H","Hansen, Morten Lock","Hansen, Peter Riis","Tolstrup, Janne Schurmann","Lindhardsen, Jesper","Selmer, Christian","Ahlehoff, Ole","Olsen, Anne-Marie Schjerning","Gislason, Gunnar","Torp-Pedersen, Christian","Selmer, Christian","Olsen, Anne-Marie Schjerning"],"cuid":["S02-087.16-735553"],"filters":{"added":"2021-10","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"11-50 contributors","class":"merged","cluster_size":2,"level":"sci","mra":["med","soc"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-HO","DI-U"],"level3":{"HO":["DI-HO-ALL","DI-HO-CAP"],"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-KU","DI-U-SDU"]},"level3all":["DI-HO-CAP","DI-U-KU","DI-U-SDU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"validation of risk stratification schemes for predicting stroke and thromboembolism in patients with atrial fibrillation nationwide cohort study","src":["ku","sdu"],"src-code":["DI-U-KU","DI-U-SDU"],"type":"dja","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","type":"doi","url":"https://doi.org/10.1136/bmj.d124","version":"Other Version"},"id":"S02-087.16-735553","identifier":[{"id":"79551645746","type":"scopus"},{"id":"21282258","type":"pmid"}],"ids":["ku-ad8c1511-3476-4338-8c14-4a5edc099341","sdu-50792cf7-0942-4eb8-83eb-357d62cab909"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Medical Science","Social Science"],"noi":["Global-Local-2-5-EC787675784B55BD74DBA45ED9EF370D"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","type":"doi","url":"https://doi.org/10.1136/bmj.d124","version":"Other Version"}],"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"sdu university of southern denmark","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-SDU","l3nl":"University of Southern Denmark","l3nn":"SDU University of Southern Denmark","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"SDU University of Southern Denmark","namevar":["SDU, The Faculty of Health Sciences, National Institute of Public Health","SDU, The Faculty of Health Sciences, National Institute of Public Health, Department of Population Health and Morbidity"],"nora_code":"DI-U-SDU","used":1},{"affno":"2","country":"dk","key":"capital region of denmark","l2":"DI-HO","l2n":"Hospitals","l3":"DI-HO-CAP","l3nl":"Capital Region of Denmark","l3nn":"Capital Region of Denmark","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"Capital Region of Denmark","namevar":["Gentofte Hospital"],"nora_code":"DI-HO-CAP","used":1},{"affno":3,"key":"ku university of copenhagen","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-KU","l3nl":"University of Copenhagen","l3nn":"KU University of Copenhagen","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"KU University of Copenhagen","namevar":["Københavns Universitet, Faculty of Health and Medical Sciences, Department of Clinical Medicine, Section of Surgery and Internal Medicine"],"nora_code":"DI-U-KU"}],"person":[{"affno":"","first":"Jonas Bjerring","key":"olesenjonasbjerringpau","last":"Olesen","locid":"5626613c-5467-4196-8e58-7c45e7c438fa","name":"Olesen, Jonas Bjerring","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"","first":"Gregory Y H","key":"lipgregoryyhpau","last":"Lip","name":"Lip, Gregory Y H","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"","first":"Morten Lock","key":"hansenmortenlockpau","last":"Hansen","locid":"870786a1-f42f-40fa-b820-1608236b578c","name":"Hansen, Morten Lock","rank":3,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"","first":"Peter Riis","key":"hansenpeterriispau","last":"Hansen","locid":"9ab3e639-a02a-4ab7-9bde-d1d64cc7ecae","name":"Hansen, Peter Riis","orcid":"0000-0002-9056-535X","rank":4,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Janne Schurmann","key":"tolstrupjanneschurmannpau","last":"Tolstrup","locid":"c03b1732-7c6e-404e-a542-e7d02e2b2575","name":"Tolstrup, Janne Schurmann","orcid":"0000-0002-9796-3967","rank":5,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"","first":"Jesper","key":"lindhardsenjesperpau","last":"Lindhardsen","locid":"a8dcf7b1-332a-456e-b0b8-72a67eaf4ce6","name":"Lindhardsen, Jesper","rank":6,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"","first":"Christian","key":"selmerchristianpau","last":"Selmer","name":"Selmer, Christian","rank":7,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"","corresponding":null,"first":"Christian Selmer","key":"buhlchristianselmerpau","last":"Buhl","name":"Buhl, Christian Selmer","rank":7,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"2","corresponding":null,"first":"Ole","key":"ahlehoffolepau","last":"Ahlehoff","name":"Ahlehoff, Ole","rank":8,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"","first":"Anne-Marie Schjerning","key":"olsenannemarieschjerningpau","last":"Olsen","name":"Olsen, Anne-Marie Schjerning","rank":9,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"","first":"Gunnar Hilmar","key":"gislasongunnarpau","last":"Gislason","locid":"c0f678a6-eb13-49a3-9485-8fae1e72e2a1","name":"Gislason, Gunnar","name_org":"Gislason, Gunnar Hilmar","rank":10,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"2","corresponding":null,"first":"Gunnar Hilmar","key":"gislasongunnarhilmarpau","last":"Gislason","name":"Gislason, Gunnar Hilmar","rank":10,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"","first":"Christian","key":"torppedersenchristianpau","last":"Torp-Pedersen","locid":"f71bedc6-3736-4559-b937-6a18e770616e","name":"Torp-Pedersen, Christian","rank":11,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"","corresponding":null,"first":"Christian Tobias","key":"torppedersenchristiantobiaspau","last":"Torp-Pedersen","name":"Torp-Pedersen, Christian Tobias","rank":11,"rolecode":"pau"}],"pmid":["21282258"],"pub":{"doi":"10.1136/bmj.d124","issn":["09598146","17561833"],"issn_org":["09598146"],"journal":"BMJ","paperid":"d124","publisher":"BMJ Publishing Group","status":"p","title":"BMJ","title_org":"The BMJ","volume":"342"},"review":"Peer Reviewed","scoID":["2-s2.0-79551645746"],"search":{"DAF":["All Danish Affiliations","All Hospitals","All Universities","Capital Region of Denmark","DI-ALL","DI-HO","DI-HO-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","Hospitals","Universities","University of Copenhagen","University of Southern Denmark"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["ku-ad8c1511-3476-4338-8c14-4a5edc099341","sdu-50792cf7-0942-4eb8-83eb-357d62cab909"],"src":["KU University of Copenhagen","SDU University of Southern Denmark"],"title":"Validation of risk stratification schemes for predicting stroke and thromboembolism in patients with atrial fibrillation : nationwide cohort study","type":"Journal Article","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S02-087.16-735553","year":"2011","yearsub":"2011"}
{"abstract":"OBJECTIVE: To examine the effect of proton pump inhibitors on adverse cardiovascular events in aspirin treated patients with first time myocardial infarction. DESIGN: Retrospective nationwide propensity score matched study based on administrative data. Setting All hospitals in Denmark. PARTICIPANTS: All aspirin treated patients surviving 30 days after a first myocardial infarction from 1997 to 2006, with follow-up for one year. Patients treated with clopidogrel were excluded. MAIN OUTCOME MEASURES: The risk of the combined end point of cardiovascular death, myocardial infarction, or stroke associated with use of proton pump inhibitors was analysed using Kaplan-Meier analysis, Cox proportional hazard models, and propensity score matched Cox proportional hazard models. Results 3366 of 19,925 (16.9%) aspirin treated patients experienced recurrent myocardial infarction, stroke, or cardiovascular death. The hazard ratio for the combined end point in patients receiving proton pump inhibitors based on the time dependent Cox proportional hazard model was 1.46 (1.33 to 1.61; P<0.001) and for the propensity score matched model based on 8318 patients it was 1.61 (1.45 to 1.79; P<0.001). A sensitivity analysis showed no increase in risk related to use of H(2) receptor blockers (1.04, 0.79 to 1.38; P=0.78). Conclusion In aspirin treated patients with first time myocardial infarction, treatment with proton pump inhibitors was associated with an increased risk of adverse cardiovascular events.","author_count":18,"contributors":["Charlot, Mette Gitz","Grove, Erik","Hansen, Peter Riis","Olesen, Jonas Bjerring","Ahlehoff, Ole","Buhl, Christian Selmer","Lindhardsen, Jesper","Madsen, Jan K","Køber, Lars","Torp-Pedersen, Christian","Gislason, Gunnar","Olesen, Jonas Bjerring","Selmer, Christian Laust Weise"],"cuid":["S02-092.50-014646"],"filters":{"added":"2021-10","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"11-50 contributors","class":"merged","cluster_size":2,"keyword":["Adult","Aged","Aspirin","Cardiovascular Diseases","Denmark","Drug Interactions","Humans","Kaplan Meier Estimate","Middle Aged","Myocardial Infarction","Platelet Aggregation Inhibitors","Prognosis","Propensity Score","Proton pump inhibitors","Recurrence","Retrospective Studies","Risk Factors","Stroke"],"level":"sci","mra":["med"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-OT","DI-U"],"level3":{"OT":["Unspecified organisation"],"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-AU","DI-U-KU"]},"level3all":["DI-U-AU","DI-U-KU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"proton pump inhibitor use and risk of adverse cardiovascular events in aspirin treated patients with first time myocardial infarction nationwide propensity score matched study","src":["au","ku"],"src-code":["DI-U-AU","DI-U-KU"],"type":"dja","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","type":"doi","url":"https://doi.org/10.1136/bmj.d2690","version":"Other Version"},"id":"S02-092.50-014646","identifier":[{"id":"79956336197","type":"scopus"},{"id":"21562004","type":"pmid"}],"ids":["au-1c36e31e-053f-48a7-9f2f-597d0ce76e8b","ku-dfc3c52a-9d72-48cd-988a-5b95183860d5"],"keyword":["Adult","Aged","Aspirin","Cardiovascular Diseases","Denmark","Drug Interactions","Humans","Kaplan-Meier Estimate","Middle Aged","Myocardial Infarction","Platelet Aggregation Inhibitors","Prognosis","Propensity Score","Proton Pump Inhibitors","Recurrence","Retrospective Studies","Risk Factors","Stroke"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Medical Science"],"noi":["Global-Local-2-5-A5D4982213D9AF8E6130F97CF8D18B13"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","type":"doi","url":"https://doi.org/10.1136/bmj.d2690","version":"Other Version"}],"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"miscellaneous","l2":"DI-OT","l2n":"Miscellaneous","l3":"DI-OT","l3nl":"Other Research","l3nn":"Miscellaneous","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"Miscellaneous","namevar":["Unspecified organisation"],"nora_code":"DI-OT","used":1},{"affno":"2","key":"au aarhus 